  "editorialSummary": "Nothing captures the delicate balance of modern civilization quite like [U.S. immigration authorities mocking detainees](https://oglobo.globo.com/mundo/noticia/2026/11/01/ice-usa-thriller-de-michael-jackson-em-video-no-halloween-para-debochar-de-migrantes-presos-nos-eua.ghtml) on TikTok while [North Korea pockets billions](https://www.channelnewsasia.com/east-asia/north-korea-tradertraitor-hackers-pyongyang-binance-crypto-heist-6510661) through automated cyber heists and [Australian property values slide](https://www.smh.com.au/politics/federal/homes-losing-9000-a-month-as-rba-mulls-another-rate-hike-20261102-p61a95.html?ref=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_source=rss_feed) into a slow-motion abyss. At least Mayo Clinic researchers are rolling out [an experimental pancreatic vaccine](https://oglobo.globo.com/saude/noticia/2026/10/30/cancer-de-pancreas-vacina-experimental-ativa-defesas-do-organismo-em-quase-100percent-dos-pacientes.ghtml) to help us survive whatever corporate dystopia arrives next Tuesday.",
